{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026K36qpAcG8v1789383620.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>元朗區議員施駿興與女童非法性交罪成，在區域法院被判監兩年半。</p><p></p><p>案情指，39歲被告施駿興2008年任話劇導師助手，認識當時11歲、讀小學的事主。之後二人發展成情侶，並在2011年3月14日發生性行為。經審訊後，他被裁定與16歲以下女童非法性交罪成，非法罪就不成立。</p><p></p><p>法官陳廣池早上在區域法院，判被告即時監禁兩年半。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:23:06.709578+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:58:41.244968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:46.856357+00:00","content_hash":"d35fa6b5322273f39039459cddf634047085741c9c376e3cbd917ec4d0d4eba4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:23:06.709578+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}